@startuml 2.2.13_L2
title L2 – Components & Access
actor LO as "Logistics Operator"
participant UI as "SPA"
participant API as "PortOps API"
participant RB as "RBAC"
database DB as "DB"

LO -> UI : Create/Update/Search
UI -> API : POST/PATCH/GET ... + JWT
API -> RB : Check(LOGISTICS_OPERATOR)
RB --> API : Allowed
API -> DB : CRUD Qualification
DB --> API : OK / Conflict / NotFound
API --> UI : 2xx/4xx
@enduml